<title>USA: MedPlus Inc says expects significant order.</title>
<headline>MedPlus Inc says expects significant order.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedPlus Inc said on Tuesday it signed a letter of intent for what it expects to be the largest order in MedPlus history.</p>
<p>MedPlus said in a statement that Valley Medical Center in Renton, Wash., plans to purchase a MedPlus ChartMaxx system to automate patient medical records and be integrated with other systems.</p>
<p>However, MedPlus said its statements were forward looking and results of the negotiations &quot;could differ from those anticipated.&quot;</p>
<p>MedPlus makes health care systems and software.</p>
<p>((Cleveland Newsdesk, Susan Zimmerman 216-579-0077))</p>
